utions, and Parades htt...</title><link>https://iris.to/npub2f531285b31bf0143e6bedaed08d223a.../note/505aefefb1922a3a6c41aff0efdec6f188afe0efe4aae5f001dc01e9d4cdc57a</link><description>Of Kings, Constitutions, and Parades https://mitchelltribe.com/2025/06/15/of-kings-constitutions-and-parades/</description><guid isPermaLink="false">505aefefb1922a3a6c41aff0efdec6f188afe0efe4aae5f001dc01e9d4cdc57a</guid><pubDate>Mon, 16 Jun 2025 01:23:29 GMT</pubDate></item><item><title>Killer Heat, 2024 - ★½ (contains spoiler...</title><link>https://iris.to/npub2f531285b31bf0143e6bedaed08d223a.../note/863e7a909a47235112cabf0e90725d12c2f34a9f7e95589bc2be6c48559e5eff</link><description>Killer Heat, 2024 - ★½ (contains spoilers) https://mitchelltribe.com/2025/06/15/killer-heat-contains-spoilers/</description><guid isPermaLink="false">863e7a909a47235112cabf0e90725d12c2f34a9f7e95589bc2be6c48559e5eff</guid><pubDate>Sun, 15 Jun 2025 05:29:12 GMT</pubDate></item><item><title>I’ll agree on one thing with the new Sam...</title><link>https://iris.to/npub2f531285b31bf0143e6bedaed08d223a.../note/028f20c4d361a261aeb3a07030a38f56f66f204c213564664fc4312d9874e4cf</link><description>I’ll agree on one thing with the new Samsung One UI 7 on my Galaxy S24 Ultra — the battery indicator 🔋 is basically useless now. I’m also not a fan of the new dot-style notification bar 🔘. That said, I’m fine with everything else 👍, though there does seem to be a bit more battery drain 🔻. #Samsung #OneUI7</description><guid isPermaLink="false">028f20c4d361a261aeb3a07030a38f56f66f204c213564664fc4312d9874e4cf</guid><pubDate>Fri, 13 Jun 2025 00:58:10 GMT</pubDate></item><item><title>📷 #mbjune Day 12: Hidden Axel’s idea of ...</title><link>https://iris.to/npub2f531285b31bf0143e6bedaed08d223a.../note/06b52b94b64b4e5e92ade5bc741d146e026f82ffdd876c838e7162b5cf4c6c5e</link><description>📷 #mbjune Day 12: Hidden Axel’s idea of “hidden” is becoming one with the tree. 🌳😹&lt;br/&gt;&lt;br/&gt;&lt;img src="https://cdn.uploads.micro.blog